00:00:30.271 --> 00:00:31.938
BELIEVES WHAT HE IS SAYING,

00:00:31.939 --> 00:00:34.741
WHY IS HE FLYING ON PRIVATE

00:00:34.742 --> 00:00:35.075
PLANES?

00:00:35.076 --> 00:00:36.342
A SINCERE QUESTION?

00:00:36.343 --> 00:00:37.777
&gt;&gt; LET'S NOT GET DISTRACTED

00:00:37.778 --> 00:00:40.046
