00:00:40.047 --> 00:00:40.947
&gt;&gt; Tucker: OH, OH, OH.

00:00:40.948 --> 00:00:41.881
NO, NO, NO.

00:00:41.882 --> 00:00:43.583
I'M NOT GOING TO LET YOU OFF

00:00:43.584 --> 00:00:44.818
THAT EASILY.

00:00:44.819 --> 00:00:47.320
WHY IS IT NOT A REAL ISSUE

00:00:47.321 --> 00:00:51.291
IF CLIMATE CHANGE AS TOLD US

00:00:51.292 --> 00:00:53.126
ONLY ISSUE THAT MATTERS WHY

00:00:53.127 --> 00:00:54.294
AREN'T WE LIVING LIKE IT'S

00:00:54.295 --> 00:00:55.595
THE ONLY ISSUE THAT MATTERS?

00:00:55.596 --> 00:00:56.863
&gt;&gt; IT COMES DOWN TO THE

00:00:56.864 --> 00:00:57.230
INDUSTRY.

00:00:57.231 --> 00:00:59.199
IF THE INDUSTRY WANTS TO

00:00:59.200 --> 00:01:00.834
MAKE PLANES THAT EXIST OFF

00:01:00.835 --> 00:01:02.769
OF RENEWABLE ENERGY RATHER

00:01:02.770 --> 00:01:06.439
THAN OIL AND GAS, THEN, WE

00:01:06.440 --> 00:01:07.741
WILL ALL BE ABLE TO LIVE ON

00:01:07.742 --> 00:01:08.508
THIS PLANET.

00:01:08.509 --> 00:01:09.442
STARTS AT THE INDUSTRY

00:01:09.443 --> 00:01:10.710
LEVEL, NOT THE CONSUMER.

00:01:10.711 --> 00:01:11.878
IT'S REALLY NOT FAIR TO PUT

00:01:11.879 --> 00:01:13.680
THE TAX ON THE INDIVIDUAL.

00:01:13.681 --> 00:01:14.781
&gt;&gt; Tucker: IT'S NOT FAIR FOR

00:01:14.782 --> 00:01:15.715
SOMEONE WHO IS TELLING US

00:01:15.716 --> 00:01:17.050
THE PLANET IS BEING

00:01:17.051 --> 00:01:18.451
DESTROYED TO LIVE IN A WAY

00:01:18.452 --> 00:01:19.586
THAT SUGGESTS THAT HE

00:01:19.587 --> 00:01:20.820
ACTUALLY BELIEVES THE PLANET

00:01:20.821 --> 00:01:22.188
IS BEING DESTROYED.

00:01:22.189 --> 00:01:23.723
I HONESTLY REALLY DON'T GET

00:01:23.724 --> 00:01:23.990
IT.

00:01:23.991 --> 00:01:25.125
IF YOU ARE AL GORE AND YOU

00:01:25.126 --> 00:01:26.159
SAY NOTHING IS MORE

00:01:26.160 --> 00:01:26.860
IMPORTANT THAN CLIMATE

00:01:26.861 --> 00:01:27.193
CHANGE.

00:01:27.194 --> 00:01:28.261
I'M A BETTER PERSON THAN YOU

00:01:28.262 --> 00:01:29.729
ARE BECAUSE I CARE MORE THAN

00:01:29.730 --> 00:01:29.996
YOU.

00:01:29.997 --> 00:01:31.531
BY THE WAY I HAVE ONE OF THE

00:01:31.532 --> 00:01:32.699
LARGEST HOUSES IN NASHVILLE

00:01:32.700 --> 00:01:35.201
AND PRIVATE AND TAKE A IT

00:01:35.202 --> 00:01:37.771
YOU BURR BAN TO THE AIRPORT.

00:01:37.772 --> 00:01:39.606
SINCERELY, WHY IS THAT OKAY?

00:01:39.607 --> 00:01:41.608
&gt;&gt; INDIVIDUAL CHOICES ARE

00:01:41.609 --> 00:01:42.675
NOT GOING TO SOLVE THE

00:01:42.676 --> 00:01:43.877
DISASTER THAT WE ARE FACING.

00:01:43.878 --> 00:01:45.411
WE ALREADY HAVE A MIGRATION

00:01:45.412 --> 00:01:45.712
ISSUE.

00:01:45.713 --> 00:01:46.579
WE ALREADY HAVE FLOODING.

00:01:46.580 --> 00:01:47.614
WE ALREADY HAVE HURRICANES

00:01:47.615 --> 00:01:49.983
THAT HAVE HIT PUERTO RICO,

00:01:49.984 --> 00:01:52.018
HAVE HIT NEW ORLEANS, HAVE

00:01:52.019 --> 00:01:54.087
HIT FLORIDA AND PLACED SO

00:01:54.088 --> 00:01:55.054
MANY WORKING PEOPLE.

00:01:55.055 --> 00:01:55.655
INDUSTRY CHANGE.

00:01:55.656 --> 00:01:58.124
WE HAVE TO CAP EMISSIONS

00:01:58.125 --> 00:01:58.491
GLOBALLY.

00:01:58.492 --> 00:02:00.093
IF WE DON'T CAP EMISSIONS

00:02:00.094 --> 00:02:01.795
BIG INDUSTRIES AND POLICY

00:02:01.796 --> 00:02:02.929
THEN THOSE INDIVIDUAL

00:02:02.930 --> 00:02:06.399
CHOICES MEAN NOTHING.

00:02:06.400 --> 00:02:07.567
&gt;&gt; Tucker: HOLD ON,

00:02:07.568 --> 00:02:08.535
INDIVIDUAL CHOICES ALWAYS

00:02:08.536 --> 00:02:09.002
MEAN SOMETHING.

00:02:09.003 --> 00:02:11.771
&gt;&gt; IN A LIBERTARIAN FANTASY

00:02:11.772 --> 00:02:12.138
WORLD.

00:02:12.139 --> 00:02:12.806
&gt;&gt; Tucker: I'M NOT A

00:02:12.807 --> 00:02:13.640
LIBERTARIAN AND NOT LIVING

00:02:13.641 --> 00:02:14.808
IN A FANTASY WORLD.

00:02:14.809 --> 00:02:16.609
IN A REAL LIFE INDIVIDUAL

00:02:16.610 --> 00:02:17.944
CHOICES MATTER OR ELSE

00:02:17.945 --> 00:02:19.612
WHAT'S THE POINT OF ANY OF

00:02:19.613 --> 00:02:20.213
THIS.

00:02:20.214 --> 00:02:20.947
LIBERALS USED TO SAY IT

00:02:20.948 --> 00:02:22.081
STARTS WITH ONE PERSON.

00:02:22.082 --> 00:02:23.049
THEY DON'T ANYMORE BECAUSE

00:02:23.050 --> 00:02:23.950
THEY DON'T WANT TO BE HELD

00:02:23.951 --> 00:02:25.785
TO THEIR OWN STANDARDS.

00:02:25.786 --> 00:02:27.487
THE SOLUTIONS ARE ALWAYS

00:02:27.488 --> 00:02:29.055
LIKE ORDINARY WORKING PEOPLE

00:02:29.056 --> 00:02:30.657
OUGHT TO PAY HIGHER GAS TAX.

00:02:30.658 --> 00:02:31.891
&gt;&gt; NOT THE SOLUTION AT ALL.

00:02:31.892 --> 00:02:32.692
WE ARE AGAINST.

00:02:32.693 --> 00:02:33.760
THIS PROGRESSIVES AGAINST

00:02:33.761 --> 00:02:37.163
THE NEOLIBERALS AND NEOCONS

00:02:37.164 --> 00:02:37.931
PROGRESSIVES BELIEVE THIS

00:02:37.932 --> 00:02:39.232
NEEDS TO BE A HUGE POLICY

00:02:39.233 --> 00:02:39.566
CHANGE.

00:02:39.567 --> 00:02:40.533
THE PLACE WHERE WE ARE RIGHT

00:02:40.534 --> 00:02:42.836
NOW, IF WE INCREASE THE

00:02:42.837 --> 00:02:43.570
TEMPERATURE 1 DEGREE, YOU

00:02:43.571 --> 00:02:44.971
AND I WON'T BE LIVING IN

00:02:44.972 --> 00:02:46.139
D.C. AND NEW YORK ANYMORE.

00:02:46.140 --> 00:02:48.007
WE WILL BE DISPLACED.

00:02:48.008 --> 00:02:52.378
AND INDUSTRIES WILL LOSE

00:02:52.379 --> 00:02:52.745
MONEY.

00:02:52.746 --> 00:02:53.379
&gt;&gt; Tucker: TALK ABOUT THE

00:02:53.380 --> 00:02:53.713
POLICY.

00:02:53.714 --> 00:02:54.581
SOLUTIONS THAT WILL FLOW

00:02:54.582 --> 00:02:56.082
FROM THE PREDICTIONS THAT

00:02:56.083 --> 00:02:56.983
YOU ARE MAKING.

00:02:56.984 --> 00:02:58.418
IS THERE ANY SOLUTION YOU

00:02:58.419 --> 00:02:59.719
HAVE EVER HEARD OF THAT

00:02:59.720 --> 00:03:00.553
DOESN'T INCREASE THE PRICE

00:03:00.554 --> 00:03:02.422
OF ENERGY?

00:03:02.423 --> 00:03:03.690
I HAVE NEVER HEARD OF ONE.

00:03:03.691 --> 00:03:05.191
&gt;&gt; IF YOU ARE GOING TO BE

00:03:05.192 --> 00:03:06.025
FOCUSED ON THE PRICE OF

00:03:06.026 --> 00:03:06.993
ENERGY, WE ARE NOT GOING TO

00:03:06.994 --> 00:03:08.461
HAVE A PLANET IN 10 YEARS.

00:03:08.462 --> 00:03:10.630
WE HAVE TO TALK ABOUT

00:03:10.631 --> 00:03:11.097
CHANGING --

00:03:11.098 --> 00:03:11.631
&gt;&gt; Tucker: HOLD ON.

00:03:11.632 --> 00:03:13.333
&gt;&gt; LET ME FINISH, TUCKER, LA

00:03:13.334 --> 00:03:14.634
LA LA LA LA, WE ARE GOING

00:03:14.635 --> 00:03:17.070
DOWN A RABBIT HOLE.

00:03:17.071 --> 00:03:17.704
&gt;&gt; Tucker: NO WE'RE NOT.

00:03:17.705 --> 00:03:19.706
&gt;&gt; 100 PERCENT RENEWABLE

00:03:19.707 --> 00:03:20.506
ENERGY, FORCING THE

00:03:20.507 --> 00:03:21.474
COMPANIES THAT ARE JACKING

00:03:21.475 --> 00:03:23.476
UP THE PRICES ON WORKING

00:03:23.477 --> 00:03:24.944
PEOPLE TO ACTUALLY REDUCE

00:03:24.945 --> 00:03:26.379
THEIR EMISSIONS SO THAT

00:03:26.380 --> 00:03:27.780
WORKING PEOPLE AREN'T

00:03:27.781 --> 00:03:28.147
DISPLACED.

00:03:28.148 --> 00:03:30.583
SO WORKING PEOPLE ARE PAY

00:03:30.584 --> 00:03:31.718
FOR HURRICANE DAMAGE AND

00:03:31.719 --> 00:03:33.253
HAVE CLEAN WATER AND WATER

00:03:33.254 --> 00:03:35.488
IS NOT BEING PRIVATIZED.

00:03:35.489 --> 00:03:36.155
&gt;&gt; Tucker: VOLUME IS NOT THE

00:03:36.156 --> 00:03:37.657
SAME AS AN ARGUMENT.

00:03:37.658 --> 00:03:38.258
REALLY SIMPLE QUESTION.

00:03:38.259 --> 00:03:39.893
&gt;&gt; YOU DON'T LIKE

00:03:39.894 --> 00:03:42.528
OPINIONATED WOMEN, DO YOU?

00:03:42.529 --> 00:03:43.229
&gt;&gt; Tucker: I LIVE WITH FOUR

00:03:43.230 --> 00:03:43.563
OF THEM.

00:03:43.564 --> 00:03:44.264
&gt;&gt; VOLUME.

00:03:44.265 --> 00:03:45.498
YOU ARE PRETTY LOUD.

00:03:45.499 --> 00:03:46.733
MY EAR PIECE IS BLARING

00:03:46.734 --> 00:03:48.234
RIGHT NOW.

00:03:48.235 --> 00:03:49.102
&gt;&gt; Tucker: LET ME ASK YOU A

00:03:49.103 --> 00:03:49.869
REALLY SIMPLE QUESTION.

00:03:49.870 --> 00:03:51.437
WOULD THE SOLUTIONS YOU ARE

00:03:51.438 --> 00:03:52.605
ESPOUSING NOW, WOULD THEY

00:03:52.606 --> 00:03:54.107
RAISE THE PRICE OF GASOLINE

00:03:54.108 --> 00:03:55.375
FOR WAGE EARNERS?

00:03:55.376 --> 00:03:58.344
&gt;&gt; NOT WITH THE GREEN NEW

00:03:58.345 --> 00:03:58.711
DEAL.

00:03:58.712 --> 00:03:59.379
&gt;&gt; Tucker: GAS WOULD BE THE

00:03:59.380 --> 00:03:59.779
SAME PRICE.

00:03:59.780 --> 00:04:01.314
&gt;&gt; I'M AGAINST RAISING

00:04:01.315 --> 00:04:01.781
CONSUMER PRICES.

00:04:01.782 --> 00:04:03.383
THAT IS A NEOLIBERAL DESIGN.

00:04:03.384 --> 00:04:04.584
I'M A DEMOCRATIC SOCIALIST.

00:04:04.585 --> 00:04:05.852
I THINK WE SHOULD HAVE

00:04:05.853 --> 00:04:06.886
POLICIES AND ACTUALLY MAKE

00:04:06.887 --> 00:04:09.088
RICH PEOPLE MILLIONAIRES AND

00:04:09.089 --> 00:04:09.689
BILLIONAIRES AND

00:04:09.690 --> 00:04:10.523
CORPORATIONS PAY TAXES.

00:04:10.524 --> 00:04:11.624
THAT'S THE PROBLEM.

00:04:11.625 --> 00:04:12.792
NO ONE AT THE TOP IS PAYING

00:04:12.793 --> 00:04:13.826
TAXES AND THE BURDEN IS

00:04:13.827 --> 00:04:15.395
GOING TO THE CONSUMER.

00:04:15.396 --> 00:04:16.262
&gt;&gt; Tucker: BUT YOU WOULD

00:04:16.263 --> 00:04:18.031
ALLOW PRIVATE PLANES TO FLY,

00:04:18.032 --> 00:04:18.765
I GUESS, RIGHT?

00:04:18.766 --> 00:04:20.366
&gt;&gt; I THINK PRIVATE PLANES

00:04:20.367 --> 00:04:22.902
HAVE AN OBLIGATION TO CHANGE

00:04:22.903 --> 00:04:23.469
THEIR STANDARDS.

00:04:23.470 --> 00:04:26.339
THAT IS WHAT POLICY IS ALL

00:04:26.340 --> 00:04:26.739
ABOUT.

00:04:26.740 --> 00:04:28.041
&gt;&gt; Tucker: GET SOLAR PRIVATE

00:04:28.042 --> 00:04:28.374
PLANES.

00:04:28.375 --> 00:04:29.976
&gt;&gt; I DON'T KNOW HOW THAT

00:04:29.977 --> 00:04:30.877
