00:04:30.878 --> 00:04:31.511
&gt;&gt; Tucker: I DON'T EITHER.

00:04:31.512 --> 00:04:33.146
&gt;&gt; OTHER FORMS OF ENERGY.

00:04:33.147 --> 00:04:33.880
&gt;&gt; Tucker: NAME ONE.

00:04:33.881 --> 00:04:35.848
