00:04:35.849 --> 00:04:36.683
RENEWABLE ENERGY SOURCE THAT

00:04:36.684 --> 00:04:38.217
CAN POWER AN AIRPLANE.

00:04:38.218 --> 00:04:39.786
&gt;&gt; WELL, THERE IS -- WE SEE

00:04:39.787 --> 00:04:42.388
IT WITH CARS.

00:04:42.389 --> 00:04:43.156
&gt;&gt; Tucker: HEMP?

00:04:43.157 --> 00:04:44.424
I'M SERIOUS IS THERE ONE?

00:04:44.425 --> 00:04:45.825
&gt;&gt; DO YOU KNOW WHAT A PRIUS

00:04:45.826 --> 00:04:49.996
IS AND A TESLA IS?

00:04:49.997 --> 00:04:51.331
&gt;&gt; Tucker: CAN THEY POWER A

00:04:51.332 --> 00:04:51.998
BIG ELECTRIC AIRPLANE?

00:04:51.999 --> 00:04:52.665
&gt;&gt; ABSOLUTELY.

00:04:52.666 --> 00:04:54.033
I'M NO ENGINEER BUT I HAVE

00:04:54.034 --> 00:04:55.435
HEARD OF ELECTRIC CARS AND

00:04:55.436 --> 00:04:56.936
AIRPLANES AND OTHER FORMS OF

00:04:56.937 --> 00:04:57.770
ELECTRIC SOLUTIONS.

00:04:57.771 --> 00:04:59.405
THERE IS ALSO SOLAR JENNIFER

00:04:59.406 --> 00:05:00.173
RATED SO THAT THE

00:05:00.174 --> 00:05:00.974
ELECTRICITY THAT YOU ARE

00:05:00.975 --> 00:05:03.009
CHARGING WITH IS SOLAR

00:05:03.010 --> 00:05:03.409
ENERGY.

00:05:03.410 --> 00:05:04.978
&gt;&gt; Tucker: BACK TO THE

00:05:04.979 --> 00:05:05.311
SOLAR.

00:05:05.312 --> 00:05:06.813
TEXT ME A PICTURE IF YOU

00:05:06.814 --> 00:05:10.617
FIND ONE ON THE INTERNET.

